>> @@ -16441,6 +16441,7 @@ L:	linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org
>>   S:	Maintained
>>   T:	git git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/mani/mhi.git
>>   F:	Documentation/ABI/stable/sysfs-bus-mhi
