calculate absent pages for mirrored_kernelcore specially.

Signed-off-by: Wei Yang <richard.weiyang@gmail.com>
Cc: "David Hildenbrand (Arm)" <david@kernel.org>
Cc: Yuan Liu <yuan1.liu@intel.com>
