Closes: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260609165431.778061F00893@smtp.kernel.org/
Fixes: 3aa31a8bb11e ("dma-buf: provide phys_vec to scatter-gather mapping routine")
Cc: stable@vger.kernel.org
